---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import JsonLd from '@/components/JsonLd.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Monkey Bomb Tag How to Win — Tips & Strategies" description="Learn how to win every round in Monkey Bomb Tag. Winning conditions, early/mid/late game strategies, movement tips and common mistakes to avoid." path="/how-to-win/">
<JsonLd schema={[{ '@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'BreadcrumbList',itemListElement:[{'@type':'ListItem',position:1,name:'Home',item:'https://monkey-bomb-tag.pages.dev/'},{'@type':'ListItem',position:2,name:'How to Win',item:'https://monkey-bomb-tag.pages.dev/how-to-win/'}]},{'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'FAQPage','mainEntity':[{'@type':'Question','name':'How do you win in Monkey Bomb Tag?','acceptedAnswer':{'@type':'Answer','text':'Be the last monkey standing by avoiding the bomb. Tag other players to pass the bomb before it explodes.'}},{'@type':'Question','name':'What happens in the last 5 seconds?','acceptedAnswer':{'@type':'Answer','text':'The bomb flashes faster. Use wall jumps and sharp turns to dodge the tagged player.'}}]}]} />
<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
  <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold mb-2">How to Win in Monkey Bomb Tag</h1>
  <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-8">Complete guide to surviving every round — from beginner to advanced strategies.</p>

  <section class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Winning Condition</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-3">The goal is simple: <strong>be the last monkey standing</strong>. One player starts with the bomb and must tag another player to pass it. When the timer hits zero, whoever holds the bomb is eliminated. Rounds continue until one player remains.</p>
    <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-950/20 border border-green-200 text-sm">
      <strong>Key rule:</strong> You cannot be tagged again immediately after receiving the bomb — you have a brief immunity window. Use it to create distance.
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Early Game Strategy (10+ players)</h2>
    <ul class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
      <li><strong>Stay near the center</strong> of the map but keep moving. Edges limit your escape routes.</li>
      <li><strong>Don't chase the bomb carrier</strong> — let others get tagged first. Early game is about positioning, not aggression.</li>
      <li><strong>Learn the map layout.</strong> Know where walls, platforms and shortcuts are.</li>
      <li><strong>Stay at mid-range</strong> from other players — close enough to react, far enough to escape.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Mid Game Strategy (5-9 players)</h2>
    <ul class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
      <li><strong>Keep track of who has the bomb.</strong> With fewer players, the bomb comes back around faster.</li>
      <li><strong>Use vertical space.</strong> Wall jump to higher ground — bomb carriers have a harder time reaching you.</li>
      <li><strong>Bait other players</strong> into groups, then escape when the carrier approaches.</li>
      <li><strong>Conserve your movement options.</strong> Don't waste stamina or special moves unnecessarily.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Late Game Strategy (2-4 players)</h2>
    <ul class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
      <li><strong>The bomb timer is shorter now.</strong> Every second counts — practice with our <a href="/bomb-timer/" class="text-green-600 hover:underline font-semibold">Bomb Timer</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Use sharp turns and direction changes</strong> to dodge the carrier. Predictable movement = elimination.</li>
      <li><strong>Wall jump chains</strong> are your best friend. Master 2-3 consecutive wall jumps.</li>
      <li><strong>If you have the bomb:</strong> Cut off escape routes, corner your target against walls, and tag before the timer runs out.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Movement Tips</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
      <div class="p-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm mb-1">Wall Jump</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Jump toward a wall and press jump again on contact. Chain multiple wall jumps to reach high platforms and escape the carrier.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm mb-1">Sharp Turns</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Quickly change direction to break the carrier's pursuit angle. Combine with wall jumps for maximum evasion.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm mb-1">Platform Drops</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Drop through platforms quickly to create vertical distance. Most maps have multiple levels you can drop between.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm mb-1">Vine Swings</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Some maps have vines. Use them to cover large distances quickly and escape tight situations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Common Mistakes</h2>
    <ul class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
      <li><strong>Running in straight lines</strong> — too easy for the carrier to predict and catch you.</li>
      <li><strong>Panicking when you get the bomb</strong> — stay calm, find the nearest player, and tag them.</li>
      <li><strong>Ignoring the timer</strong> — always know how much time is left. Practice with our <a href="/bomb-timer/" class="text-green-600 hover:underline font-semibold">Bomb Timer tool</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Camping in corners</strong> — corners are death traps. The carrier can trap you easily.</li>
      <li><strong>Not learning map layouts</strong> — knowing shortcuts and hiding spots gives a massive advantage.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
    <a href="/bomb-timer/" class="px-4 py-2 bg-red-500 text-white rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold">Bomb Timer</a>
    <a href="/best-strategy/" class="px-4 py-2 bg-purple-600 text-white rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold">Best Strategy</a>
    <a href="/beginner-guide/" class="px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold">Beginner Guide</a>
    <a href="/codes/" class="px-4 py-2 bg-green-500 text-white rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold">Free Codes</a>
  </div>
</div>
</BaseLayout>
